exists su name video cuts audio filename ob text "/workplace/artifacts/say/love-teaching-shorts.wav" be default ya
exists su name video cuts prefix ob text "love-teaching-shorts" be default ya

su name draw size shorts be map def
  su name width ob num 720 ya
  su name height ob num 1280 ya
  su name negative prompt ob text "text, letters, typography, watermark, logo, caption, subtitle, signature, brand name, label, poster, UI, interface, numbers" ya
prah

su name love teaching shorts be refinery def

su name manuscript ob text "Write a spoken teaching manuscript that teaches people how to love God. Focus on concrete actions humans can take to love God. About 90 words. Plain language." for name mind to name text manuscript out be write do

su name telling from name manuscript ob name manuscript out to filename "/workplace/artifacts/say/love-teaching-shorts.wav" be piper say do

su name hear from name telling from filename "/workplace/artifacts/say/love-teaching-shorts.wav" become wo srt to filename "/workplace/artifacts/footnote/love-teaching-shorts.srt" be hear do

su name cut platform from filename of ob of hear platform during num 6 to filename "/workplace/artifacts/footnote/love-teaching-shorts.cuts.pya" be cut do

exists su name teaching cuts ob filename "/workplace/artifacts/footnote/love-teaching-shorts.cuts.pya" be itinerary ya

su name prompt stage ob text "node command/itinerary_promptify.mjs \"/workplace/artifacts/footnote/love-teaching-shorts.cuts.pya\" \"/workplace/artifacts/footnote/love-teaching-shorts.prompts.pya\"" be command do

exists su name teaching draw prompts ob filename "/workplace/artifacts/footnote/love-teaching-shorts.prompts.pya" be itinerary ya

su name draw platform from name itinerary teaching draw prompts ob text "Create one illustration representing this:" fromstate wo text become wo photograph with name draw size shorts as text "love-teaching-shorts" be draw do

su name concatenate platform from name itinerary teaching cuts fromstate wo itinerary become wo video be concatenate do

su name footnote platform from filename of ob of hear platform fromstate wo srt with filename of ob of concatenate platform become wo video to filename of ob of concatenate platform as wo wordflow be footnote do

su name report ob text "Generated teaching shorts video in run artifacts folder." be write do
prah

from name love teaching shorts be refinery do
ob text "love teaching shorts complete." be write do
